error[E0277]: a `std::string::String` field can't share a column of `f64`
 --> tests/ui/derive_dataframe_type_collision.rs:9:16
  |
9 |     B { value: String },
  |         -----  ^^^^^^ the same-named fields of every variant share one column, typed as the first variant writes it
  |         |
  |         `std::string::String` doesn't satisfy the trait bound
  |
  = help: the trait `miniextendr_api::dataframe::SameColumn<f64>` is not implemented for `std::string::String`
  = note: to keep fields of different types in one column as text, put `#[dataframe(conflicts = "string")]` on the enum

